# arm: mosaic
# sentence-level interleaving; survey first; editing to make seams cohere
# created 2026-08-13. Deltas from the base; everything unlisted falls through.
#
# Runs every day beside the base, into sync/Obsidian/Posts/mosaic/.
# bin/arm.sh promote mosaic folds these into profiles/base.env.

CURATE_DIRECTIVE=$BLOG_REPO_DIR/profiles/directives/mosaic.md
VERBATIM_MIN=40
NEW_SLACK_EVERY=3
GLUE_MAX_WORDS=30
GATE_TRACE=1
# quotas deliberately absent: inherited from the base, so the only thing
# this arm changes is how it writes.
